      "id": "claim_a56f35cc817149e19ed20360fe1f225e",
      "statement": "The desktop Qt entry point creates QApplication and runs the Qt event loop. MainWindow handles launch and starts the EmuThread after the shared core successfully loads the process. QtCommon supplies the control thread, which reports shader-cache progress, releases the graphics context, starts the GPU and signals CPU readiness.",
