    {
      "id": "claim_c9cc255fea5c4d3aaae707269a3fefdf",
      "statement": "SDL_AppQuit guards guest pause and shutdown with IsPoweredOn. Quit can be called even when initialization exited early, such as for help output, so the guard protects uninitialized kernel state. The callback releases the frontend state and shuts down networking if it was initialized.",
